ltering for restricted content'=>'受限内容的网站地图过滤','Search engine visibility controls'=>'搜索引擎可见性控制','Permission-aware XML sitemaps'=>'权限感知的 XML 网站地图','YooTheme'=>'YooTheme','Compatibility with YooTheme builder and term permissions.'=>'与 YooTheme 构建器和术语权限的兼容性。','Builder interface compatibility'=>'构建器界面兼容性','Term permission integration'=>'术语权限集成','Template access controls'=>'模板访问控制','Viewing'=>'查看','Access Circles'=>'访问圈','Editing Permissions'=>'编辑权限','Compatibility Pack'=>'兼容性包','Teaser'=>'预告片','File Access'=>'文件访问','Membership'=>'会员资格','User Posts'=>'用户帖子','Visibility Circles and Editorial Circles block access to content not authored by other group members.'=>'可见性圈和编辑圈阻止访问其他组成员未创作的内容。','Post-specific and category-specific permissions for creation and editing.'=>'特定于帖子和类别的创建和编辑权限。','Integration with ACF, bbPress, BuddyPress, Relevanssi, WPML and other plugins; enhanced Multisite support.'=>'与 ACF、bbPress、BuddyPress、Relevanssi、WPML 和其他插件集成；增强的多站点支持。','On the site front end, display teaser text for unreadable posts instead of hiding them.'=>'在站点前端，显示不可读帖子的预告文本，而不是隐藏它们。','Restrict direct file requests based on user\'s access to the page a file is attached to.'=>'基于用户对文件附加页面的访问限制直接文件请求。','Time-limit access customizations by delaying or expiring Permission Group membership.'=>'通过延迟或到期权限组成员资格来限制时间限制访问自定义。','Auto-create a page for each user of specified roles. Compatible with several Team / Staff plugins.'=>'为指定角色的每个用户自动创建页面。与多个团队/员工插件兼容。','Visibility Circles and Editorial Circles block access to content not authored by other group members. Any WP Role, BuddyPress Group or custom Group can be marked as a Circle for specified post types.'=>'可见性圈和编辑圈阻止访问其他组成员未创作的内容。任何 WP 角色、BuddyPress 组或自定义组都可以标记为特定帖子类型的圈。','Supports content-specific permissions for editing, term assignment and page parent selection. In combination with other modules, supports workflow statuses, PublishPress and PublishPress Revisions.'=>'支持特定内容的权限，用于编辑、术语分配和页面父级选择。与其他模块结合使用，支持工作流状态、PublishPress 和 PublishPress 修订版。','Adds compatibility or integration with ACF, bbPress, Relevanssi, CMS Tree Page View, Custom Post Type UI, Subscribe2, WPML, various other plugins. Configure any BuddyPress Group as a Permissions Group. For multisite, provides network-wide Permission Groups.'=>'增加与 ACF、bbPress、Relevanssi、CMS 树页面视图、自定义帖子类型 UI、Subscribe2、WPML 和其他各种插件的兼容性或集成。将任何 BuddyPress 组配置为权限组。对于多站点，提供网络范围的权限组。','On the site front end, replace non-readable content with placeholder text. Can be enabled for any post type. Custom filters are provided but no programming is required for basic usage.'=>'在站点前端，用占位符文本替换不可读内容。可以为任何帖子类型启用。提供自定义过滤器，但基本使用不需要编程。','Filters direct file access, based on user\'s access to post(s) which the file is attached to. No additional configuration required. Creates/modifies .htaccess file in uploads folder (and in main folder for multisite).'=>'过滤直接文件访问，基于用户对文件附加的帖子访问。无需额外配置。在上传文件夹中创建/修改 .htaccess 文件（对于多站点，在主文件夹中也进行修改）。','Allows Permission Group membership to be date-limited (delayed and/or scheduled for expiration). Simple date picker UI alongside group membership selection.'=>'允许权限组成员资格有限制日期（延迟和/或计划到期）。简单的日期选择器界面与组成员资格选择并存。','Create or synchronize posts to match users. Designed for Team / Staff plugins, but with broad usage potential.'=>'创建或同步帖子以匹配用户。为团队/员工插件设计，但具有广泛的使用潜力。','If you like %s, please leave us a %s rating. Thank you!'=>'如果您喜欢%s，请给我们留下%s评分。谢谢！','About PublishPress Permissions'=>'关于PublishPress权限','About'=>'关于','Permissions Documentation'=>'权限文档','Documentation'=>'文档','Contact the PublishPress team'=>'联系 PublishPress 团队','Contact'=>'联系','Permission Group'=>'权限组','Specific Permissions: restrictions (\'Blocked\') take priority over additions (\'Enabled\')'=>'特定权限：限制（‘被阻止’）优先于添加（‘启用’）','Specific Permissions: no restrictions (\'Blocked\') can be applied to custom-defined groups'=>'特定权限：无法对自定义定义的组应用任何限制（\'已阻止\'）','Extra Roles assignment available for {All} and {Anonymous} metagroups'=>'为 {All} 和 {Anonymous} 元组提供额外角色分配','Allow the {All} and {Anonymous} metagroups 