ument'=>'当应用 Teaser 并启用重定向时，将原始 URL 附加为 redirect_to 参数','For Teaser compatibility, specify a redirect argument to use instead of redirect_to'=>'为了兼容 Teaser，指定一个重定向参数以替代 redirect_to','For Teaser compatibility, specify an additional redirect argument other than redirect_to'=>'为了兼容 Teaser，指定一个除了 redirect_to 之外的额外重定向参数','For Teaser compatibility, prevent the pp_permissions argument from being appended to redirects'=>'为了兼容 Teaser，防止 pp_permissions 参数被附加到重定向中','Filter priority for \'get_pages\' filter (default: 1)'=>'\'get_pages\' 过滤器的过滤优先级（默认值：1）','Don\'t include readable private pages in the Pages widget or other wp_list_pages() / get_pages() results    '=>'不要在页面小部件或其他 wp_list_pages() / get_pages() 结果中包含可读的私有页面    ','If some pages have been suppressed from get_pages() results, change child pages\' corresponding post_parent values to a visible ancestor'=>'如果某些页面已从 get_pages() 结果中隐藏，请将子页面的相应 post_parent 值更改为可见的祖先','Never modify the post_parent value in the get_pages() result set, even if some pages have been suppressed'=>'永远不要修改 get_pages() 结果集中的 post_parent 值，即使某些页面已被隐藏','For performance, change the get_pages() database query to return only a subset of fields, excluding post_content'=>'为了性能，将 get_pages() 数据库查询更改为仅返回子集字段，排除 post_content','Don\'t apply content teaser to get_pages() results (leave unreadable posts hidden)'=>'不要对 get_pages() 结果应用内容 Teaser（保持不可读的帖子隐藏）','If some terms have been suppressed from get_terms() results, change child terms\' corresponding parent values to a visible ancestor'=>'如果某些术语已从 get_terms() 结果中隐藏，请将子术语的相应 parent 值更改为可见的祖先','Never modify the parent value in the get_terms() result set, even if some terms have been suppressed'=>'永远不要修改 get_terms() 结果集中的 parent 值，即使某些术语已被隐藏','Set Author to current user if autoset_post_author / autoset_page_author capability is assigned'=>'如果分配了 autoset_post_author / autoset_page_author 权限，则将作者设置为当前用户','Leave Media Library with normal access criteria based on user\'s role capabilities '=>'根据用户的角色权限，使用正常的访问标准离开媒体库',