ber of any custom Permission Groups.'=>'该用户不是任何自定义权限组的成员。','Edit this user\'s group membership'=>'编辑该用户的组成员身份','Note: BuddyPress Groups and other externally defined groups are not listed here, even if they modify permissions'=>'注意：BuddyPress 群组和其他外部定义的群组在此未列出，即使它们修改了权限。','%s, more...'=>'%s，更多...','edit user permissions'=>'编辑用户权限','Assign to %s'=>'分配给 %s','Assign (All Types)'=>'分配（所有类型）','%s (All Types)'=>'%s（所有类型）','Permissions: %1$s in %2$s'=>'权限：%1$s 在 %2$s 中','Displayed permissions are those assigned for the "%1$s" type. You can also %2$sdefine universal %3$s permissions which apply to all related post types%4$s.'=>'显示的权限是分配给 "%1$s" 类型的权限。您还可以 %2$s定义适用于所有相关帖子类型的通用 %3$s 权限%4$s。','Permissions: Assign this %2$s to %3$s'=>'权限：将此 %2$s 分配给 %3$s','Permissions: Assign this %2$s for All Post Types'=>'权限：为所有帖子类型分配此 %2$s','Permissions: %1$s %2$s in this %3$s'=>'权限：%1$s %2$s 在此 %3$s 中','Permissions: %1$s all content in this %2$s for All Post Types'=>'权限：%1$s 在此 %2$s 中的所有内容适用于所有帖子类型','Permissions: %1$s this %2$s'=>'权限：%1$s 这个 %2$s','Displayed permissions are those assigned for the "%1$s" type.%2$sYou can also %3$sdefine universal %4$s permissions which apply to all related post types%5$s.'=>'显示的权限是分配给 "%1$s" 类型的权限。%2$s您还可以 %3$s定义适用于所有相关帖子类型的通用 %4$s 权限%5$s。','Listed permissions are those assigned for the "%1$s" type. You can also %2$sdefine universal %3$s permissions which apply to all related post types%4$s.'=>'列出的权限是分配给 "%1$s" 类型的权限。您还可以 %2$s定义适用于所有相关帖子类型的通用 %3$s 权限%4$s。','Click to list/edit universal permissions'=>'点击以列出/编辑通用权限','%1$s Permissions %2$s*%3$s'=>'%1$s 权限 %2$s*%3$s','Universal Permissions'=>'通用权限','Permissions&hellip;'=>'权限&hellip;','Add'=>'添加','Add selected users to Permission Group'=>'将选定用户添加到权限组','Remove selected users from Permission Group'=>'从权限组中移除选定用户','Click to show only users who have no group'=>'点击仅显示没有组的用户','Click to show only users who have extra roles'=>'点击仅显示具有额外角色的用户','Click to show only users who have Specific Permissions assigned directly'=>'点击仅