o attachments of unreadable posts, %1$supgrade to Permissions Pro%2$s and enable the File Access feature.'=>'要阻止对不可读帖子附件的直接 URL 访问，%1$s升级到 Permissions Pro%2$s 并启用文件访问功能。','Customize'=>'自定义','To customize publication workflow, %1$sinstall PublishPress Statuses%2$s.'=>'要自定义发布工作流程，请%1$s安装 PublishPress 状态%2$s。','Show list of Permissions Pro features and screencasts'=>'显示权限专业版功能和屏幕录像列表','Knowledge Base'=>'知识库','Detailed Feature Grid'=>'详细功能网格','Contact Us'=>'联系我们','Purchase'=>'购买','Hide'=>'隐藏','None. All %ss will be hidden by default.'=>'无。所有%ss将默认隐藏。','Add Selected Permissions'=>'添加选定的权限','If you need help or have a new feature request, let us know.'=>'如果您需要帮助或有新的功能请求，请告诉我们。','Upgrade to Pro'=>'升级到专业版','Request Support'=>'请求支持','Detailed documentation is also available on the plugin website.'=>'详细文档也可在插件网站上获取。','View Knowledge Base'=>'查看知识库','All settings were updated.'=>'所有设置已更新。','All settings were reset to defaults.'=>'所有设置已重置为默认值。','Save Changes'=>'保存更改','Upgrade to Permissions Pro'=>'升级到权限专业版','Need Permissions Support?'=>'需要权限支持吗？','If disabled, manually "blocked" posts can be unblocked by specific Category / Term Permissions.'=>'如果禁用，手动“阻止”的帖子可以通过特定的分类/术语权限解除阻止。','If enabled, corresponding Media edit and delete capabilities must be added to existing roles.'=>'如果启用，必须将相应的媒体编辑和删除权限添加到现有角色中。','For specialized Media Library permissions, enable the Editing Permissions feature.'=>'要获取专业的媒体库权限，请启用编辑权限功能。','To customize bbPress forum permissions, activate the Compatibility Pack feature.'=>'要自定义 bbPress 论坛权限，请激活兼容性包功能。','To customize bbPress forum permissions, activate your Permissions Pro license key.'=>'要自定义 bbPress 论坛权限，请激活您的 Permissions Pro 许可证密钥。','Remove the "Private:" and "Protected" prefix from Post, Page titles.'=>'从帖子、页面标题中移除“私有：”和“受保护”前缀。','If the user is blocked from reading posts in a category, also block access to category archive page.'=>'如果用户被阻止阅读某个类别的帖子，则也要阻止访问该类别的存档页面。','Remove unreadable Menu Items. If menu rendering problems occur with a third party plugin, disable this setting.'=>'删除不可读菜单项。如果与第三方插件发生菜单渲染问题，请禁用此设置。','Unmodified from WordPress default behavior. To enable filtering, remove constant definition PP_ADMIN_READONLY_LISTABLE.'=>'未修改 WordPress 默认行为。要启用过滤，请移除常量定义 PP_ADMIN_READONLY_LISTABLE。','Note: Groups and Roles are always displayed on the Edit User screen.'=>'注意：组和角色始终显示在编辑用户界面上。','Disable Permissions filtering for users who are not logged in.'=>'对于未登录的用户，禁用权限过滤。','Legacy compatibility: front end term filters are not applied on some sites.'=>'遗留兼容性：某些站点上的前端术语过滤未应用。','If checked, pages blocked from the "All" or "Logged In" groups will still be listed to Administrators.'=>'如果选中，从“所有”或“已登录”组中阻止的页面仍会列出给管理员。','Display a role dropdown alongside the user search input box to narrow results.'=>'在用户搜索输入框旁边显示一个角色下拉菜单，以缩小结果范围。','Display descriptive captions on Permissions screens.'=>'在权限屏幕上显示描述性标题。','Display descriptive captions for features available in missing or deactivated modules.'=>'为缺失或停用模块中的可用功能显示描述性标题。','Extra Roles cause "_posts" capabilities in the Pattern Role (Author, Editor, etc.) to be assigned for the selected post type. Enable this setting to also include all other capabilities in the Pattern Role.'=>'额外角色会导致在所选帖子类型中为模式角色（作者、编辑等）分配 "_posts" 权限。启用此设置还将包括模式角色中的所有其他权限。','Detect user roles which are appended dynamically but not stored to the WP database. May be useful for sites that sync with Active Directory or other external user registration systems.'=>'检测动态附加但未存储到WP数据库的用户角色。对与Active Directory或其他外部用户注册系统同步的网站可能有用。','You can adjust some Permissions behavior by %1$s adding capabilities to a WordPress role%2$s.'=>'您可以通过 %1$s 向WordPress角色添加权限 %2$s 来调整某些权限行为。','You can add Permissions capabilities to a role using the %1$s plugin.'=>'您可以使用 %1$s 插件为角色添加权限功能。','Regardless of this setting, the pp_set_view_permissions capability is also required.'=>'无论此设置如何，pp_set_view_permissions 功能也是必需的。','Regardless of this setting, the pp_set_edit_permissions capability is also required.'=>'无论此设置如何，pp_set_edit_permissions 功能也是必需的。','Settings related to content editing permissions, provided by the %s module.'=>'与内容编辑权限相关的设置，由 %s 模块提供。','If this setting is disabled, you can enable a role by giving it capabilities: list_others_posts, list_others_published_pages, etc.'=>'如果此设置被禁用，您可以通过授予以下权限来启用角色：list_others_posts、list_others_published_pages等。','Display a custom column on Edit Posts screen for all related taxonomies which are enabled for Permissions filtering.'=>'在编辑帖子屏幕上显示一个自定义列，列出所有启用权限过滤的相关分类法。','Allows creation of a new post (of any type) for each selected user, using an existing post as the pattern.'=>'允许为每个选定用户创建一个新帖子（任何类型），使用现有帖子作为模板。','Other users will be unable to publish new top-level pages (Parent = "Main Page"), or move a published page from "Main Page" to a different Parent.'=>'其他用户将无法发布新的顶级页面（父级 = "主页面"），或将已发布的页面从 "主页面" 移动到其他父级。','This feature has been moved to PublishPress Capabilities > Editor Features > Element IDs. Please use the Capabilities plugin for better organization and enhanced functionality.'=>'此功能已移至PublishPress能力 > 编辑器功能 > 元素ID。请使用能力插件以更好地组织和增强功能。','The following settings are currently overridden by the constant PP_MEDIA_LIB_UNFILTERED (defined in wp-config.php or some other file you maintain). Media Library access will not be altered by Permissions.'=>'以下设置当前被常量PP_MEDIA_LIB_UNFILTERED（在wp-config.php或您维护的其他文件中定义）所覆盖。媒体库访问将不受权限影响。','Show files uploaded by others users if they are attached to a post the user is allowed to view.'=>'如果其他用户上传的文件附加到用户可以查看的帖子，则显示这些文件。','Show files uploaded by other users if they are attached to a post the user is allowed to edit.'=>'如果其他用户上传的文件附加到用户可以编辑的帖子，则显示这些文件。','Allow users to edit files uploaded by other users if they are attached to a post the user is allowed to edit.'=>'允许用户编辑附加到用户可以编辑的帖子中的其他用户上传的文件。','Show users all the files in the Media Library. Unchecking this box will hide media files that are uploaded by other users.'=>'向用户显示媒体库中的所有文件。取消选中此框将隐藏其他用户上传的媒体文件。','Stop users from editing files uploaded by other users unless they are attached to a post the user is allowed to edit.'=>'阻止用户编辑其他用户上传的文件，除非它们附加到用户可以编辑的帖子中。','Allow users to edit files they have uploaded, regardless of other restrictions.'=>'允许用户编辑他们上传的文件，而不考虑其他限制。','Allow non-Administrators to rename menu items they cannot fully edit. Menu items will be locked into current positions.'=>'允许非管理员重命名他们无法完全编辑的菜单项。菜单项将锁定在当前的位置。','Prevent creation or editing of custom items for non-Administrators who lack edit_theme_options capability.'=>'防止没有 edit_theme_options 权限的非管理员创建或编辑自定义项目。','Prevent non-Administrators with user editing permissions from editing a higher-level user or assigning a role higher than their own.'=>'防止拥有用户编辑权限的非管理员编辑更高级别的用户或分配高于自己角色的权限。','Circle members will be blocked from accessing Revisions authored by non-members.'=>'圈子成员将被阻止访问由非成员撰写的修订。','Enable post contributors or authors with pp_set_edit_permissions capability to set editing Permissions on posts authored by others'=>'启用具有 pp_set_edit_permissions 功能的帖子贡献者或作者为他人撰写的帖子设置编辑权限','Permissions setting \'Pages can be set or removed from Top Level by\' applies to \'page\' type only'=>'权限设置 \'页面可以由\' 设置或移除到顶级仅适用于 \'页面\' 类型','If user cannot generally save pages to top level but a page they are editing is already there, allow it to stay at top level even if not yet published '=>'如果用户通常无法将页面保存到顶级，但他们正在编辑的页面已经在那里，即使尚未发布，也允许它保持在顶级 ','Circle membership does not limit page association (page parent setting) ability'=>'圈子成员资格不会限制页面关联（页面父级设置）的能力','Determines the default value of Permissions > Settings > Editing > Auto-assign default term'=>'确定权限 > 设置 > 编辑 > 自动分配默认术语的默认值','Always auto-assign a category if none are selected and user lacks permission for default category'=>'如果没有选择任何类别并且用户缺少默认类别的权限，则始终自动分配一个类别','Always auto-assign a post tag if none are selected'=>'如果没有选择，则始终自动分配一个帖子标签','Always auto-assign a term of this taxonomy if none are selected'=>'如果没有选择，则始终自动分配此分类法的一个术语','Determines the default setting of Permissions > Settings > Editing > Auto-assign default terms'=>'确定权限 > 设置 > 编辑 > 自动分配默认术语的默认设置','Do not auto-assign a category (except standard default category if user has permission)'=>'不要自动分配类别（如果用户有权限则除外标准默认类别）','Do not auto-assign a post tag'=>'不要自动分配帖子标签','Do not auto-assign a term of this taxonomy'=>'不要自动分配此分类法的术语','Do not auto-assign a term if the user has permission for more than one term in the taxonomy'=>'如果用户在分类法中对多个术语有权限，则不要自动分配术语','If auto-assign term setting is enabled, apply it even if user does not have term assignment limitations'=>'如果启用了自动分配术语设置，即使用户没有术语分配限制，也要应用此设置','Don\'t define an \'Approved\' status, even if Status Control feature is active'=>'即使状态控制功能已激活，也不要定义\'已批准\'状态','If user has Nav Menu management capabilities but can\'t \'edit_theme_options\', strip link out of wp-admin Appearance Menu instead of linking it to nav-menus'=>'如果用户具有导航菜单管理权限但无法 \'edit_theme_options\'，则从 wp-admin 外观菜单中删除链接，而不是将其链接到 nav-menus','Don\'t credit implicit \'manage_nav_menus\' capability to users who have \'edit_theme_options\' or \'switch_themes\' capability'=>'不要将隐式的 \'manage_nav_menus\' 权限授予具有 \'edit_theme_options\' 或 \'switch_themes\' 权限的用户','Prevent non-Administrators from adding new Nav Menu items to top level (add below existing editable items instead)'=>'防止非管理员将新的导航菜单项添加到顶级（而是在现有可编辑项下方添加）','For non-Administrators, new Nav Menu items default to being a child of first editable item '=>'对于非管理员，新导航菜单项默认为第一个可编辑项的子项 ','Don\'t require any additional capabilities for management of Nav Menu settings (normally require \'manage_menu_settings\', \'edit_others_pages\' or \'publish_pages\') '=>'管理导航菜单设置不要求任何额外权限（通常需要 \'manage_menu_settings\'、\'edit_others_pages\' 或 \'publish_pages\'） ','Eliminate extra filtering queries on Nav Menu update, even for non-Administrators'=>'消除导航菜单更新上的额外筛选查询，即使对于非管理员','Don\'t allow non-Administrators to see others\' unattached uploads, regardless of Permissions settings.  Their own unattached uploads are still accessible unless option \'own_attachments_always_editable\' is set false'=>'不允许非管理员查看其他用户的未附加上传，即使在权限设置中也是如此。除非将选项\'own_attachments_always_editable\'设置为false，否则他们自己的未附加上传仍然可以访问。','Limited User Editors can assign their own role'=>'有限用户编辑者可以分配自己的角色','Post Meta fields to copy when using \'Add Author Page\' dropdown on Users screen'=>'在用户屏幕上使用\'添加作者页面\'下拉菜单时要复制的帖子元字段','Manage PublishPress Permissions plugin settings.'=>'管理PublishPress权限插件设置。','Access the Teaser settings admin screen.'=>'访问预告设置管理屏幕。','PublishPress Permissions will not apply any Extra Roles or Permissions to limit or expand viewing or editing access.'=>'PublishPress权限不会应用任何额外角色或权限来限制或扩展查看或编辑访问。','Manage other user\'s Permissions. Also grants capabilities for all post types and statuses.'=>'管理其他用户的权限。还授予所有帖子类型和状态的能力。','Create new Permission Groups and set the name and description.'=>'创建新的权限组并设置名称和描述。','Edit the name and description of existing Permission Groups.'=>'编辑现有权限组的名称和描述。','Delete Permission Groups.'=>'删除权限组。','If group editing is allowed, can also modify group membership.'=>'如果允许组编辑，还可以修改组成员资格。','Assign Extra Roles or Permissions on the Edit Permissions screen.'=>'在编辑权限屏幕上分配额外角色或权限。','Set Viewing Permissions for specific Posts, Categories or Terms.'=>'为特定帖子、类别或术语设置查看权限。','Set Editing Permissions for specific Posts, Categories or Terms.'=>'为特定帖子、类别或术语设置编辑权限。','Set Revision Permissions for specific Posts, Categories or Terms.'=>'为特定帖子、类别或术语设置修订权限。','Set "Set as Parent" Permissions for specific Posts.'=>'为特定帖子设置“设置为父项”权限。','Set Term Assignment Permissions.'=>'设置术语分配权限。','Set Term Management Permissions.'=>'设置术语管理权限。','Set "Set as Parent" Permissions for specific Categories or Terms.'=>'为特定类别或术语设置“设置为父项”权限。','Edit own file uploads, even if they become attached to an uneditable post.'=>'编辑自己的文件上传，即使它们附加到不可编辑的帖子中。','See other user\'s unattached file uploads in Media Library.'=>'在媒体库中查看其他用户未附加的文件上传。','Can bypass restrictive "Set as Parent" Permissions (for all hierarchical post types).'=>'可以绕过限制性的“设为父级”权限（适用于所有层级帖子类型）。','Do not alter the Media Library listing provided by WordPress.'=>'请勿更改WordPress提供的媒体库列表。','On the Posts screen, satisfy a missing edit_posts capability by listing uneditable drafts.'=>'在帖子屏幕上，通过列出不可编辑的草稿来满足缺失的edit_posts能力。','On the Posts screen, satisfy a missing edit_others_posts capability by listing other user\'s uneditable posts.'=>'在帖子屏幕上，通过列出其他用户的不可编辑帖子来满足缺失的edit_others_posts能力。','On the Pages screen, satisfy a missing edit_private_pages capability by listing uneditable private pages.'=>'在页面屏幕上，通过列出不可编辑的私人页面来满足缺失的edit_private_pages能力。','Allow non-Administrators to Quick Edit or Bulk Edit (possibly allowing them to bypass restrictions).'=>'允许非管理员进行快速编辑或批量编辑（可能允许他们绕过限制）。','(Statuses Pro capability)'=>'（Statuses Pro能力）','Advanced'=>'高级','Advanced Settings'=>'高级设置','Network-Wide Settings'=>'网络范围设置','Editor Options'=>'编辑器选项','Page Structure'=>'页面结构','Permissions Capabilities'=>'权限能力','Front End'=>'前端','User Management'=>'用户管理','Constants'=>'常量','Role Integration'=>'角色集成','Nav Menu Editing'=>'导航菜单编辑','Miscellaneous'=>'杂项','Display all advanced settings'=>'显示所有高级设置','Use modern tabbed metabox interface'=>'使用现代选项卡元框界面','Delete settings on plugin deletion'=>'插件删除时删除设置','Post-specific Permissions take priority'=>'特定于帖子权限优先','Search Results include Media'=>'搜索结果包括媒体','Regulate access to Category archive pages'=>'规范对类别存档页面的访问','Performance: Don\'t filter category / tag counts'=>'性能：不过滤类别/标签计数','Filter Menu Items'=>'过滤菜单项','Page Parent selection for editable pages only'=>'仅可编辑页面的父页面选择','Auto-assign available term if default term is unavailable'=>'如果默认术语不可用，自动分配可用术语','List other user\'s uneditable posts'=>'列出其他用户不可编辑的帖子','Pages can be set or removed from Top Level by: '=>'页面可以通过以下方式设置或移除顶级： ','Tag creation requires Tag edit capability'=>'标签创建需要标签编辑权限','Type-specific Extra Roles grant all capabilities in Pattern Role'=>'特定类型的额外角色授予模式角色中的所有权限','Suppress "Private: " Caption'=>'抑制“私人：”标题','Select Permission Groups at User creation'=>'在用户创建时选择权限组','Permission Groups on User Profile'=>'用户资料上的权限组','Extra Roles on User Profile'=>'用户资料上的额外角色','Order Page Parent dropdown by Title'=>'按标题排序订单页面的父级下拉菜单','Add taxonomy columns to Edit Posts screen'=>'在编辑文章屏幕中添加分类法列','Allow Renaming of uneditable Items'=>'允许重命名不可编辑项','Lock custom menu items'=>'锁定自定义菜单项','Bulk Add Author Pages on Users screen'=>'在用户屏幕上批量添加作者页面','%1$sDisable%2$s all filtering for anonymous users'=>'%1$s禁用%2$s所有匿名用户的过滤','%1$sDo not apply%2$s metagroup permissions for Administrators'=>'%1$s不应用%2$s元组权限给管理员','Limit front-end category / term filtering'=>'限制前端分类/术语过滤','User Search: Filter by WP role'=>'用户搜索：按WP角色过滤','Display Administrative Hints'=>'显示管理提示','Display Module Hints'=>'显示模块提示','Detect Dynamically Mapped WP Roles'=>'检测动态映射的WP角色','Non-Administrators can set Reading Permissions for their editable posts'=>'非管理员可以为他们可编辑的文章设置阅读权限','Bulk Add / Remove Groups on Users Screen'=>'在用户屏幕上批量添加/删除组','Non-Administrators can set Editing Permissions for their editable posts'=>'非管理员可以为他们可编辑的文章设置编辑权限','Assign Publish Permissions separate from Edit Permissions'=>'分配发布权限与编辑权限分开','note: Plugin settings and configuration data will be deleted, but only after the last copy of Permissions / Permissions Pro is deleted.'=>'注意：插件设置和配置数据将被删除，但仅在最后一份权限/权限专业版被删除后。','The following would revert to default settings:'=>'以下将恢复为默认设置：','The following would change from defaults to previously stored settings:'=>'以下将从默认值更改为先前存储的设置：','no Page Parent filter'=>'无页面父级过滤','Page Authors, Editors and Administrators'=>'页面作者、编辑和管理员','Page Editors and Administrators'=>'页面编辑和管理员','Administrators'=>'管理员','When saving a post, if the default term is not selectable, substitute first available.'=>'保存帖子时，如果默认术语不可选择，则替换为第一个可用术语。','Some term-limited editing configurations require this.'=>'某些术语限制编辑配置需要此项。','If enabled, users cannot create new tags for a post unless they have the edit_tags capability. You can manage this with a WordPress role editor like PublishPress Capabilities.'=>'如果启用，用户不能为帖子创建新标签，除非他们具有edit_tags能力。您可以使用像PublishPress Capabilities这样的WordPress角色编辑器来管理这个。','If enabled, users cannot create new tags for a post unless they have the edit_tags capability. You can manage this with Capabilities > Capabilities > Taxonomies for any role.'=>'如果启用，用户不能为帖子创建新标签，除非他们具有edit_tags能力。您可以通过“能力”>“能力”>“分类法”来管理任何角色。','Display all permission operations in a single metabox with tabs (modern UI). When disabled, each operation has a separate metabox (legacy UI).'=>'在单个元框中以标签形式显示所有权限操作（现代UI）。当禁用时，每个操作都有一个单独的元框（遗留UI）。','%sPosts / Pages Listing:%s %s'=>'%s帖子 / 页面列表:%s %s','User editing capabilities apply for'=>'用户编辑权限适用于','any user'=>'任何用户','equal or lower role levels'=>'相等或较低的角色级别','lower role levels'=>'较低的角色级别','To control how Extra Roles are applied, see %1$sRole Usage%2$s.'=>'要控制如何应用额外角色，请参见 %1$s角色使用%2$s。','Defined Constant'=>'定义的常量','Setting'=>'设置','Available Constant'=>'可用常量','To modify one or more default settings network-wide, <strong>copy</strong> the following code into your theme\'s <strong>functions.php</strong> file (or some other file which is always executed and not auto-updated) and modify as desired:'=>'要全网修改一个或多个默认设置，<strong>复制</strong>以下代码到您主题的<strong>functions.php</strong>文件中（或其他始终执行而不自动更新的文件），并根据需要修改：','To force the value of one or more settings network-wide, <strong>copy</strong> the following code into your theme\'s <strong>functions.php</strong> file (or some other file which is always executed and not auto-updated) and modify as desired:'=>'要强制全网一个或多个设置的值，<strong>复制</strong>以下代码到您主题的<strong>functions.php</strong>文件中（或其他始终执行而不自动更新的文件），并根据需要修改：','All settings in this form (including those on undisplayed tabs) will be reset to DEFAULTS.  Are you sure?'=>'此表单中的所有设置（包括未显示标签上的设置）将重置为默认值。您确定吗？','Revert to Defaults'=>'恢复为默认值','General'=>'常规','Taxonomies'=>'分类法','Post Types'=>'帖子类型','Database Maintenance'=>'数据库维护','Enforce distinct edit, delete capability requirements for Media'=>'强制媒体的编辑、删除能力要求不同','Modify permissions for these Taxonomies:'=>'修改这些分类法的权限：','Modify permissions for these Post Types:'=>'修改这些帖子类型的权限：','This causes unique capabilities to be required for editing each post type. '=>'这会导致每个帖子类型的编辑需要独特的能力。','Nav Menus (Block)'=>'导航菜单（区块）','Metabox enabled'=>'已启用元框','Metabox disabled'=>'已禁用元框','Permissions screen enabled'=>'已启用权限屏幕','Permissions screen disabled'=>'已禁用权限屏幕','This feature allows you to restrict access to Media Library files when they are accessed via WordPress. To restrict viewing of files when they are visited directly via the URL, use the "File Access" feature.'=>'此功能允许您在通过WordPress访问媒体库文件时限制访问。要限制直接通过URL访问文件时的查看，请使用“文件访问”功能。','Enable metabox on %s editing screen'=>'在%s编辑屏幕上启用元框','Enable on Permissions screen'=>'在权限屏幕上启用','Make Unattached Files Private'=>'将未附加文件设为私有','Small Thumbnails Unfiltered'=>'小缩略图未过滤','Compatibility Mode: Apply extra redirect'=>'兼容模式：应用额外重定向','Media File Protection'=>'媒体文件保护','Control direct access to Media files'=>'控制对媒体文件的直接访问','Automatic .htaccess file management'=>'自动 .htaccess 文件管理','File Access key with on-demand regeneration'=>'按需再生的文件访问密钥','Pro Feature'=>'专业功能','Upgrade to Pro to unlock advanced file protection capabilities'=>'升级到专业版以解锁高级文件保护功能','Learn More'=>'了解更多','Privacy & Performance'=>'隐私与性能','Limit attachment access by post permissions'=>'通过帖子权限限制附件访问','Make unattached files private'=>'使未附加的文件私有','Directly control specific files'=>'直接控制特定文件','Optimize your site with advanced privacy and performance controls'=>'通过高级隐私和性能控制优化您的网站','Advanced Integration'=>'高级集成','Nginx integration support'=>'Nginx 集成支持','Process externally uploaded files'=>'处理外部上传的文件','Supports network (multisite) installs'=>'支持网络（多站点）安装','Get advanced integration features with Nginx, FTP, and more'=>'获取与 Nginx、FTP 等的高级集成功能','Ready to secure your files?'=>'准备好保护您的文件了吗？','Upgrade to Pro and get advanced file access control with all these features and more.'=>'升级到专业版，获得更高级的文件访问控制以及所有这些功能和更多。','Integrations'=>'集成','Compatibility Packs'=>'兼容性包','Breakdance'=>'霹雳舞','Unlock Pro Integrations'=>'解锁专业集成','Upgrade to the Pro version for optimal compatibility and prompt, professional support.'=>'升级到专业版以获得最佳兼容性和及时的专业支持。','Admin